# Pairs with SetCaptureCompletes, under the fairness Spec asserts. An aborted
# cross-tree saga's finalize records the abort but leaves its delegation row,
# so the tree reports a saga in flight forever and the drain gate never
# passes. Every saga still terminates and every safety invariant holds.
MODULE: SetCaptureCompletesAbortKeepsDelegation
TARGET: SetCaptureCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an abort's finalize keeps the delegation row, so the drain gate waits forever
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
Finalize(t, T) ==
    /\ CrossTree(t)
    /\ dec[t] # "inflight"
    /\ deleg[t][T]
    /\ ~Gated(T)
    /\ loc' = [loc EXCEPT ![t][T] = dec[t]]
    /\ deleg' = [deleg EXCEPT ![t][T] = FALSE]
--- REPLACE
Finalize(t, T) ==
    /\ CrossTree(t)
    /\ dec[t] # "inflight"
    /\ deleg[t][T]
    /\ ~Gated(T)
    /\ loc' = [loc EXCEPT ![t][T] = dec[t]]
    \* MUTATION: an abort does not drop the delegation row.
    /\ deleg' = IF dec[t] = "aborted" THEN deleg ELSE [deleg EXCEPT ![t][T] = FALSE]
--- END
